            <br>
            Rover Scouts often undertake community service projects to give back to society. Overseas projects expose Rovers to the wider world and make them grateful to live in Singapore. By fostering an interest in service, it is also hoped that Rover Scouts make their commitment to giving back to society a life long pursuit. 
