    <div class="panel panel-default">
        <div class="panel-body">
            Of course, Rover Scouts are conversant in core scouting skills, relating to knotting and lashing, pioneering, outdoor cooking, tent pitching, first aid, etc. These skills form the basis for the ambitious projects Rovers undertake. 
